# Plant Analyzer
## overview 
  we are building aw web application name "Plant Leaf Analyzer". This application should be  a prototype for my Portfolio project. Application takes the plant leaf image from the user and diagnosis the plant and provide the problem and Recommandations and also a final summary along with the Healthy Plant image. 

