## Functionality

   1. Upload image
   - Application provide an option for User to upload the image to diagnose the problem
   
   2. Plant leaf diagnosis:
   - Once the user submit the plant image, Application will make a call to LLM to provide plant information, any observations

   3. Problem finding and recommandation
   -  Once the system receives the plant information and observatiobs, It will make another LLM  call to identify the problem and provide recommandations

   4. Healthy Plant
   - once the app receives the problem and recommendations, It will make another LLM  call to get the image of the healthy plant how does it supposed to look like

   5. Response To end User:
    - Once the app receives all the information, it will present all the information to the end user in a appealing manner 


